## C baseline (frozen reference)

The C firmware in the sibling `pico-fido2/` repository is the frozen reference
baseline. fapico2 v1.1.0 is the shipped Rust firmware. The C baseline's
components include:

* pico-keys-sdk — AGPL-3.0-or-later (Copyright Pol Henarejos).
  Source: https://github.com/polhenarejos/pico-keys-sdk

fapico2 does NOT link to or vendor pico-keys-sdk; it is a clean-room Rust
rewrite on the Trussed/embassy-rp stack. The NOTICE here records the
licensing posture only.

## FIDO attestation development key

`apps/fido/src/attestation_key.bin` is a public, self-signed development
attestation key compiled into every build. The production path is per-device
attestation-key generation via TRNG.

